"4:05.480" end="4:06.073">え</span><span begin="4:06.073" end="4:06.333">て</span><span begin="4:06.333" end="4:07.420">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">寻常的清晨消失不见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itsumo no asa ga kietemo</span></p><p begin="4:07.753" end="4:14.760" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:07.753" end="4:07.943">こ</span><span begin="4:07.943" end="4:08.173">こ</span><span begin="4:08.173" end="4:08.740">で</span><span begin="4:08.740" end="4:09.733">い</span><span begin="4:09.733" end="4:09.983">つ</span><span begin="4:09.983" end="4:10.163">ま</span><span begin="4:10.163" end="4:10.393">で</span><span begin="4:10.393" end="4:11.603">だっ</span><span begin="4:11.603" end="4:12.023">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">名</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:12.023" end="4:13.043">な</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">前</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:13.043" end="4:13.400">まえ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">呼</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:13.400" end="4:13.663">よ</span></span></span><span begin="4:13.663" end="4:14.283">ぶ</span><span begin="4:14.283" end="4:14.760">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我也会在此永远呼唤你的名字</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">koko de itsu made datte namae yobu yo</span></p><p begin="4:15.233" end="4:24.420" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">胸</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:15.233" end="4:16.553">むね</span></span></span><span begin="4:16.553" end="4:16.963">に</span><span begin="4:16.963" end="4:17.543">ひ</span><span begin="4:17.543" end="4:18.083">と</span><span begin="4:18.083" end="4:18.540">つ</span><span begin="4:18.540" end="4:19.343">あ</span><span begin="4:19.343" end="4:20.173">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">傷</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:20.173" end="4:21.703">きず</span></span></span><span begin="4:21.703" end="4:24.420">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">哪怕胸口留有一道伤痕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mune ni hitotsu aru kizu mo</span></p><p begin="4:47.863" end="4:53.498" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">手</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:47.863" end="4:48.353">て</span></span></span><span begin="4:48.353" end="4:48.773">の</span><span begin="4:48.773" end="4:49.173">ひ</span><span begin="4:49.173" end="4:49.433">ら</span><span begin="4:49.433" end="4:49.960">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">落</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:49.960" end="4:50.343">お</span></span></span><span begin="4:50.343" end="4:50.793">ち</span><span begin="4:50.793" end="4:51.113">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">雫</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:51.113" end="4:53.498">しずく</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">滴落掌心的泪珠</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">te no hira ni ochiru shizuku</span></p><p begin="4:54.413" end="4:59.328" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:54.413" end="4:55.243">きっ</span><span begin="4:55.243" end="4:55.593">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">指</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:55.593" end="4:56.503">ゆび</span></span></span><span begin="4:56.503" end="4:56.923">か</span><span begin="4:56.923" end="4:57.343">ら</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">流</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:57.343" end="4:58.353">なが</span></span></span><span begin="4:58.353" end="4:58.573">れ</span><span begin="4:58.573" end="4:59.328">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">定会从指缝间滑落</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kitto yubi kara nagareru</span></p><p begin="4:59.963" end="5:06.948" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:59.963" end="5:00.200">そ</span><span begin="5:00.200" end="5:00.403">ん</span><span begin="5:00.403" end="5:00.993">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">悲</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:00.993" end="5:02.113">かな</span></span></span><span begin="5:02.113" end="5:02.413">し</span><span begin="5:02.413" end="5:02.623">み</span><span begin="5:02.623" end="5:03.823">だっ</span><span begin="5:03.823" end="5:04.223">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">変</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:04.223" end="5:05.200">か</span></span></span><span begin="5:05.200" end="5:05.473">え</span><span begin="5:05.473" end="5:05.680">て</span><span begin="5:05.680" end="5:05.883">ゆ</span><span begin="5:05.883" end="5:06.503">け</span><span begin="5:06.503" end="5:06.948">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">就连那样的悲伤也定能改变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sonna kanashimi datte kaete yukeru</span></p><p begin="5:07.513" end="5:13.538" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:07.513" end="5:08.183">あ</span><span begin="5:08.183" end="5:08.723">な</span><span begin="5:08.723" end="5:09.120">た</span><span begin="5:09.120" end="5:10.578">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">想</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:10.740" end="5:11.960">おも</span></span></span><span begin="5:11.960" end="5:12.403">う</span><span begin="5:12.403" end="5:13.538">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">只要每当想起你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">anata o omou to</span></p><p begin="5:14.003" end="5:19.940" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:14.003" end="5:14.453">こ</span><span begin="5:14.453" end="5:14.880">こ</span><span begin="5:14.880" end="5:15.300">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">殘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:15.300" end="5:16.113">のこ</span></span></span><span begin="5:16.113" end="5:16.620">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">歌</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:16.620" end="5:17.353">うた</span></span></span><span begin="5:17.353" end="5:17.763">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">中</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:17.763" end="5:19.940">なか</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在留存于此的歌声之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">koko ni nokoru uta no naka</span></p><p begin="5:20.553" end="5:25.628" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">記</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:20.553" end="5:21.020">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">憶</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:21.020" end="5:21.783">おく</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">伝</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:21.783" end="5:22.643">つた</span></span></span><span begin="5:22.643" end="5:23.020">わ</span><span begin="5:23.020" end="5:23.403">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">気</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:23.403" end="5:23.853">き</span></span></span><span begin="5:23.853" end="5:24.333">が</span><span begin="5:24.333" end="5:24.713">し</span><span begin="5:24.713" end="5:25.628">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">仿佛记忆也能得以传递</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kioku tsutawaru ki ga shita</span></p><p begin="5:26.123" end="5:33.100" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:26.123" end="5:27.073">わたし</span></span></span><span begin="5:27.073" end="5:28.173">が</span><span begin="5:28.173" end="5:28.513">ずっ</span><span begin="5:28.513" end="5:28.723">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">伝</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:28.723" end="5:29.920">つた</span></span></span><span begin="5:29.920" end="5:30.313">え</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">続</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:30.313" end="5:31.593">つづ</span></span></span><span begin="5:31.593" end="5:31.800">け</span><span begin="5:31.800" end="5:32.020">る</span><span begin="5:32.020" end="5:32.660">の</span><span begin="5:32.660" end="5:33.100">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我始终想要传达下去的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">watashi ga zutto tsutaetsuzukeru no wa</span></p><p begin="5:33.663" end="5:42.458" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:33.663" end="5:34.313">た</span><span begin="5:34.313" end="5:34.793">だ</span><span begin="5:34.793" end="5:35.333">ひ</span><span begin="5:35.333" end="5:35.853">と</span><span begin="5:35.853" end="5:36.500">つ</span><span begin="5:36.500" end="5:36.960">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">想</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:36.960" end="5:38.540">おも</span></span></span><span begin="5:38.540" end="5:39.628">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">乗</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:39.628" end="5:39.893">の</span></span></span><span begin="5:39.893" end="5:42.458">せ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">寄托着唯一的心意</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tada hitotsu no omoi nose</span></p><p begin="5:43.423" end="5:52.920" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">「愛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:43.423" end="5:44.543">あい</span></span></span><span begin="5:44.543" end="5:45.063">し</span><span begin="5:45.063" end="5:45.703">て</span><span begin="5:45.703" end="5:46.173">る」</span> <span begin="5:46.173" end="5:46.743">そ</span><span begin="5:46.743" end="5:47.368">れ</span><span begin="5:47.493" end="5:48.263">だ</span><span begin="5:48.263" end="5:49.338">け</span><span begin="5:49.338" end="5:49.663">で</span><span begin="5:49.663" end="5:52.920">す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">唯有那句“我爱你”而已</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">aishiteru sore dake desu</span></p></div></body></tt>